NAME
    m - bootstrap the technical m runtime and dispatch integrated commands

SYNOPSIS
    m
    m <command> [argument ...]

DESCRIPTION
    m resolves the RumiAI OS technical root, initializes the relocatable m
    runtime environment, exposes technical command paths, loads the core shell
    facilities and establishes the current state/resource roots.

    With no command operand, m starts the managed shell through the shell
    facility.

    With a command operand, m resolves that command through the active command
    path, exports its resolved pathname as m_COMMAND_BIN, removes the command
    operand from the argument vector and executes the command body inside the
    initialized m runtime.

    The bootstrap refuses to dispatch itself recursively as a command.

EXIT STATUS
    With a dispatched command, m returns that command's status.
    Bootstrap, root-resolution or command-resolution failures return non-zero.

